    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You can perform the surgical procedures necessary to graft <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Biotech\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Biotech\">Biotech</a> components onto living flesh, similar to those used by the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong\" title=\"Yuuzhan Vong\">Yuuzhan Vong</a>.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Trained\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trained\">Trained</a> in <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Treat_Injury\" title=\"Treat Injury\">Treat Injury</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> You can install <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bio-Implants\" title=\"Bio-Implants\">Bio-Implants</a> onto a living being. The surgical procedure takes 1 hour of uninterrupted work, after which you must make a DC 20 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Treat_Injury\" title=\"Treat Injury\">Treat Injury</a> check. If the check succeeds, the prosthesis is installed correctly. If the check fails, the prosthesis is not installed properly; however, you can try again after another uninterrupted hour of surgery.</p><p><b>Special:</b> You can install <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bio-Implants\" title=\"Bio-Implants\">Bio-Implants</a> on yourself, but you take a -5 penalty on the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Treat_Injury\" title=\"Treat Injury\">Treat Injury</a> check. If you have the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Surgical_Expertise\" title=\"Surgical Expertise\">Surgical Expertise</a> Feat, you can install a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bio-Implant\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bio-Implant\">Bio-Implant</a> in 10 minutes instead of 1 hour.</p>",
